diff --git a/docs/building.md b/docs/building.md
index 3e788386..3c9b4887 100644
--- a/docs/building.md
+++ b/docs/building.md
@@ -121,11 +121,18 @@ config/smt3/symbol_addrs.txt names and addresses
 config/smt3/cflags.txt      per-unit compiler options, with evidence
 src/smt3/<dir>/<unit>.c C units; INCLUDE_ASM marks functions not decompiled yet
 include/                    common.h, include_asm.h and shared headers
+external/sdf-decomp/        submodule: the sdf/ units and engine headers
 tools/                      build, checking, splitting and analysis tools
 docs/                       this documentation
 asm/ build/ orig/           generated or extracted locally (git-ignored)
 ```
 
+The `sdf/` units are compiled from `external/sdf-decomp/src/sdf/`, shared with
+the Digital Devil Saga decompilation, and its `include/` is searched before
+this one's. A unit keeps its `src/smt3/sdf/<unit>.c` name everywhere else (splat,
+objects, reports); `tools/sources.py` maps it to the file. Every unit is built
+with `-DSDF_SMT3`, which the shared code uses for SMT3-only parts.
+
 `.text` is in the `main` splat segment, split into named C units and
 `code_<vram>` placeholders. Preserve the configured boundaries; see
 [TU recovery](tu-recovery.md).
